  "criterion_altered": false,
  "criterion_quoted": "HWIR is a total, fingerprint-stable, honest-hole hardware IR that REFUSES what it cannot represent. Over the corpus C = {from_qgemv(), from_organ_map(FLASH_ORGAN_MAP), from_organ_map(QWEN_ORGAN_MAP)} + the five declared negative controls + one single-node probe graph per primitive in HARDWARE_PRIMITIVE_CATALOG per registered lowering target, all five clauses hold:\n\n(a) ROUND-TRIP CONSERVATION. For every graph G in C, from_json(G.to_json()).to_json() is byte-identical to G.to_json(), the round-tripped fingerprint equals G.fingerprint(), and no wall-clock timestamp appears in the serialisation. An IR whose identity is not conserved across serialisation cannot address an artifact.\n\n(b) VALIDATOR DISCRIMINATION. validate(G).ok is True for exactly the legal graphs and False for exactly the negative controls; each control yields its own declared code; and every observed code is one of the twelve the module declares. A validator that accepts everything, or that reports one code for every defect, discriminates nothing.\n\n(c) LOWERING TOTALITY. For every registered target T, supported(T) and cannot_express(T) are disjoint, their union covers HARDWARE_PRIMITIVE_CATALOG exactly, and handwritten_hdl(T) is a non-empty subset of cannot_express(T). On the per-primitive probe graph, p is emitted if and only if p is supported, and p is reported as a hole if and only if p is in cannot_express. A target may not silently drop a primitive it neither emits nor declares it cannot express.\n\n(d) TARGET INVARIANCE. For every G and every T, lower_hwir(G, T)['graph_fingerprint'] equals G.fingerprint(), the result key set is identical across targets, and every manifest carries preferred=False and toolchain_choice=None. Lowering must not perturb graph identity, and no target may be a ranked default.\n\n(e) REFUSAL. For every negative control, lowering RAISES rather than returning a document. An IR that emits a plausible kernel artifact for a graph its own validator rejects has published a lie in a form synthesis will not catch.",
